From 3da71ce7f921f16392bf454eddbd1c421bfbdd32 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joey Perrott <josephperrott@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Mar 2026 13:26:54 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] build: update repository locations for bazel rules (#32866)

* build: update repository locations for bazel rules

The repositories for `rules_sass`, `rules_angular`, and `rules_browsers`
were recently transferred from devversion to the angular organization.
This commit updates the internal bazel module rules to rely on
the new repository locations.

* fixup! build: update repository locations for bazel rules
